{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A snapshot references the live components and entity identifier generator of the nexus. Encode it right after creation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encoded form starts with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","isActive":true},{"text":" and lists all entities in ascending identifier order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each with its original identifier (the raw value, here with generation 0) and its components keyed by their stable ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"formatVersion\": 3,","  \"entityIdGenerator\": { \"nextFreshId\": 3, \"recycledIds\": [] },","  \"entities\": [","    { \"id\": 1, \"components\": { \"MyGame.Position\": { \"x\": 1, \"y\": 2 } } },","    { \"id\": 2, \"components\": {}, \"sharedComponents\": { \"MyGame.Position\": 1 } }","  ]","}"],"syntax":"json"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" is present if the generator of the nexus is a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"sharedComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is present for entities that share a component instance with an entity listed before them.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Components are values since 2.0, so snapshots never write it; it is still read from older data.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It maps the component type name to the identifier of the entity that encodes the instance.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Version history:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1: Entities and their components.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2: Adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sharedComponents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3: Entity identifiers are encoded as 64 bit raw values holding the slot index and generation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The generator state lists recycled identifiers as ","type":"text"},{"code":"recycledIds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Snapshots of versions 1 and 2 still load. Their identifiers decode with generation 0.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The slot index 0 is reserved and never used for entities, so an entity with index 0 in an older snapshot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gets a fresh identifier when the snapshot is restored, and references to it are remapped to that identifier.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"All other entities keep their identifiers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An encodable view of the entities of a nexus and their serializable components."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Snapshots","anchor":"Snapshots","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceResolver","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceError"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/Member"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/entityIdGenerator","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/members"]},{"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/Encodable-Implementations"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexussnapshot"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS13NexusSnapshotV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NexusSnapshot"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NexusSnapshot"}],"title":"NexusSnapshot","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"kind":"symbol","i